    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "CORE EXPLANATION\n",
      "size": 20,
      "color": "#6A1B9A",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Run a Python file from the terminal and read arguments with sys.argv. Starting a module with python -m helps package-relative imports work correctly.\n\n",
      "size": 17
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "EXAMPLE CODE\n",
      "size": 20,
      "color": "#1565C0",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "QUESTION: What will this code print? Predict first, then run it.\n",
      "size": 16,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "code": "import sys\nfrom unittest.mock import patch\n\nwith patch('sys.argv', ['lesson.py', 'first', 'second']):\n    print('arguments:', sys.argv[1:])",
      "showCopyButton": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "EXPECTED RESULT\n",
      "size": 20,
      "color": "#2E7D32",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "code": "arguments: ['first', 'second']",
      "showCopyButton": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "LINE-BY-LINE WALKTHROUGH\n",
      "size": 15,
      "color": "#37474F"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "import sys",
      "size": 15,
      "color": "#1565C0",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " — Imports functionality from a module; without it, the name is unavailable and may raise NameError.\n",
      "size": 15,
      "color": "#37474F"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "from unittest.mock import patch",
      "size": 15,
      "color": "#1565C0",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " — Imports specific names from a module; without it, those names are unavailable.\n",
      "size": 15,
      "color": "#37474F"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "with patch('sys.argv', ['lesson.py', 'first', 'second']):",
      "size": 15,
      "color": "#1565C0",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " — Manages a resource for the block; without the context manager, a file or connection may remain open.\n",
      "size": 15,
      "color": "#37474F"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "print('arguments:', sys.argv[1:])",
      "size": 15,
      "color": "#1565C0",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " — Runs an expression; print displays a value and calls may have side effects—without the line, that action does not occur.\n\n",
      "size": 15,
      "color": "#37474F"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "REMEMBER\n",
      "size": 19,
      "color": "#00897B",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "python -m runs a module in its package context.\n\n",
      "size": 17,
      "color": "#00695C",
      "bold": true,
      "italic": true
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "title": "Important tip",
